                        "entry_id": "549bd682-fe57-3435-baa2-3cef66de45e8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The senior member of a group in Japanese arts; a mentor."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a634a770-93c5-42a2-82d3-efde11a8b5d7",
                                "sense_id": "ff6c1259-979f-37e8-a9d4-578abb587e92",
                                "text": "Senpai are also known to intercede on behalf of their kohai to explain their mistakes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7c5ff578-bc91-403a-858a-5fc6e8325c20",
                                "sense_id": "ff6c1259-979f-37e8-a9d4-578abb587e92",
                                "text": "They usually act as a mentor for kōhai, although in reality not all senpai are as generous or genuine about mentoring junior colleagues."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1765afef-e6e0-4e67-a87e-c52f40cf0f87",
                                "sense_id": "ff6c1259-979f-37e8-a9d4-578abb587e92",
                                "text": "Many senpai attend the same dōjō for decades."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
